{"__formatVersion":2,"__revision":"9f45445a81cc2a77","__entryId":"spring","entry":{"sceneUI":["<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;padding:6px 0\">\n        <div style=\"width:130px\">\n          <div style=\"height:58px;border:1.5px dashed var(--brand);border-radius:8px;background:var(--brand-light);opacity:.55\"></div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:5px\">原来的位置</div>\n        </div>\n        <span style=\"font-size:15px;color:var(--text-3)\">↩</span>\n        <div style=\"width:140px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float);transform:rotate(3deg)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">首页改版走查</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">拖拽中…松手回弹</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:6px\">spring：松手冲回原位，轻轻过冲再停稳，像有物理质量</div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;height:118px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n        <div style=\"padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:58%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:78%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:42%\"></i></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(29,33,41,.32)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(.88);width:224px;height:74px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;opacity:.3\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:224px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">邀请成员</div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\">\n            <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"flex:1\" value=\"fox@example.com\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-primary\">邀请</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:8px\">scale 短暂越过 1 后回到稳定值；残影表示上一帧位置</div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text)\">通知提醒</span>\n          <span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block;width:56px;height:32px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--brand)\">\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;left:9px;top:13px;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.35)\"></span>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;left:17px;top:12px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.5)\"></span>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;right:1px;top:3px;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.22)\"></span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:12px\">滑块短暂越过目标位置后回弹；左侧残影表示运动轨迹</div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;max-width:280px;margin:0 auto;height:138px\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--brand-light)\">\n          进行中\n          <span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">▾</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;top:40px;left:8px;right:8px;height:90px;border:1.5px dashed var(--brand);border-radius:8px;opacity:.35;transform:scale(.96);transform-origin:top\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;top:40px;left:0;right:0;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float);padding:4px;transform-origin:top\">\n          <div style=\"padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;border-radius:5px;color:var(--text-2)\">全部状态</div>\n          <div style=\"padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand);font-weight:500\">进行中</div>\n          <div style=\"padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;border-radius:5px;color:var(--text-2)\">已完成</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:8px\">从触发点弹性展开：scale 0.96 → 1，虚线是上一帧</div>\n    </div>"],"sceneUI_en":["<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;padding:6px 0\">\n        <div style=\"width:130px\">\n          <div style=\"height:58px;border:1.5px dashed var(--brand);border-radius:8px;background:var(--brand-light);opacity:.55\"></div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:5px\">Original position</div>\n        </div>\n        <span style=\"font-size:15px;color:var(--text-3)\">↩</span>\n        <div style=\"width:140px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float);transform:rotate(3deg)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Home page revision review</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Draging...rebound when you let go</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:6px\">spring: Let go and rush back to the original position, overshoot lightly and then stop, as if there is physical quality</div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;height:118px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n        <div style=\"padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:58%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:78%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:42%\"></i></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(29,33,41,.32)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(.88);width:224px;height:74px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;opacity:.3\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:224px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">Invite members</div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\">\n            <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"flex:1\" value=\"fox@example.com\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Invite</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:8px\">scale briefly crosses 1 and then returns to a stable value; the afterimage indicates the position of the previous frame</div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text)\">Notification reminder</span>\n          <span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block;width:56px;height:32px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--brand)\">\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;left:9px;top:13px;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.35)\"></span>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;left:17px;top:12px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.5)\"></span>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;right:1px;top:3px;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.22)\"></span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:12px\">The slider briefly crosses the target position and then rebounds; the residual image on the left indicates the movement trajectory</div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;max-width:280px;margin:0 auto;height:138px\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--brand-light)\">\n          In progress\n          <span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">▾</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;top:40px;left:8px;right:8px;height:90px;border:1.5px dashed var(--brand);border-radius:8px;opacity:.35;transform:scale(.96);transform-origin:top\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;top:40px;left:0;right:0;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float);padding:4px;transform-origin:top\">\n          <div style=\"padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;border-radius:5px;color:var(--text-2)\">All status</div>\n          <div style=\"padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand);font-weight:500\">In progress</div>\n          <div style=\"padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;border-radius:5px;color:var(--text-2)\">Completed</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:8px\">Elastic expansion from the trigger point: scale 0.96 → 1, the dotted line is the previous frame</div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"spring-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"stiffness\"><span class=\"spring-anat-tag\">刚度 stiffness</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"damping\"><span class=\"spring-anat-tag\">阻尼 damping</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"overshoot\"><svg class=\"spring-anat-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 90 46\"><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"86\" y2=\"16\" class=\"spring-anat-targetline\"/><path d=\"M4,42 C38,42 42,2 58,12 C70,20 76,16 86,16\" class=\"spring-anat-path\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"target\"><span class=\"spring-anat-tag\">目标值</span></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"spring-anat\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"stiffness\"><span class=\"spring-anat-tag\">stiffness</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"damping\"><span class=\"spring-anat-tag\">damping</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"overshoot\"><svg class=\"spring-anat-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 90 46\"><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"86\" y2=\"16\" class=\"spring-anat-targetline\"/><path d=\"M4,42 C38,42 42,2 58,12 C70,20 76,16 86,16\" class=\"spring-anat-path\"/></svg></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"target\"><span class=\"spring-anat-tag\">target value</span></span></span>","parts":[{"key":"stiffness","cn":"刚度","en":"Stiffness","desc":"弹簧多硬，决定运动多快","desc_en":"Stiffness: how strongly the spring pulls toward its target."},{"key":"damping","cn":"阻尼","en":"Damping","desc":"摩擦力多大，决定晃几下停","desc_en":"Damping: how quickly the motion loses energy and stops bouncing."},{"key":"overshoot","cn":"过冲","en":"Overshoot","desc":"数值短暂越过目标后回到稳定位置","desc_en":"The value briefly passes the target, then settles back into place."},{"key":"target","cn":"目标值","en":"Target","desc":"最终停住的位置","desc_en":"The final resting position"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"硬弹簧","en":"Stiff","demo":"<svg class=\"spring-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 44\"><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"16\" class=\"spring-v-target\"/><path d=\"M4,38 C50,38 58,10 76,15 C88,19 96,16 116,16\" class=\"spring-v-path\"/></svg>","demo_en":"<svg class=\"spring-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 44\"><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"16\" class=\"spring-v-target\"/><path d=\"M4,38 C50,38 58,10 76,15 C88,19 96,16 116,16\" class=\"spring-v-path\"/></svg>","when":"干脆利落，工具型产品","when_en":"For a crisp, restrained feel in a productivity tool"},{"cn":"软弹簧","en":"Soft","demo":"<svg class=\"spring-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 44\"><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"20\" class=\"spring-v-target\"/><path d=\"M4,40 C40,40 44,2 62,14 C76,25 82,13 94,19 C102,23 108,20 116,20\" class=\"spring-v-path\"/></svg>","demo_en":"<svg class=\"spring-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 44\"><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"20\" class=\"spring-v-target\"/><path d=\"M4,40 C40,40 44,2 62,14 C76,25 82,13 94,19 C102,23 108,20 116,20\" class=\"spring-v-path\"/></svg>","when":"温和活泼，内容社交产品","when_en":"For a gentle, lively feel in a content or social product"},{"cn":"无过冲","en":"No Bounce","demo":"<svg class=\"spring-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 44\"><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"14\" class=\"spring-v-target\"/><path d=\"M4,38 C54,38 66,14 116,14\" class=\"spring-v-path\"/></svg>","demo_en":"<svg class=\"spring-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 44\"><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"14\" class=\"spring-v-target\"/><path d=\"M4,38 C54,38 66,14 116,14\" class=\"spring-v-path\"/></svg>","when":"要活感但不要回弹","when_en":"When you want the motion to feel alive without overshooting"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>拖拽松手回弹</b>：卡片、列表跟着手势，物理感最对","m":"spring-drag"},{"t":"<b>{c:modal}、面板入场</b>：需要轻快语气时可用轻微过冲；严肃或高风险流程应保持稳定","m":"spring-enter"},{"t":"<b>按实现的参数调手感</b>：常见有刚度、阻尼、质量、初速度或时长；不同库的模型与默认值不同","m":"spring-params"},{"t":"<b>Framer Motion</b>：弹簧是默认手感，一行配置就有","m":"spring-fm"}],"dont":[{"t":"<b>反复回弹</b>：会延迟稳定状态，并分散用户对任务的注意","m":"spring-bouncy","bad":true},{"t":"<b>高风险确认使用明显弹性</b>：回弹可能分散注意力；优先保证信息与操作状态稳定清楚","m":"spring-serious","bad":true},{"t":"<b>阻尼过小</b>：可能造成持续振荡，状态难以及时稳定","m":"spring-wobble","bad":true},{"t":"<b>每个元素都弹</b>：会削弱层级；只在有明确反馈目的时使用","m":"spring-everything","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"拖拽卡片松手后需要回到目标位置，同时不能持续晃动。怎样处理更合适？","options":[{"id":"settling-spring","label":"使用项目现有动画方案做一次轻微过冲并快速停稳，减少动态效果时直接到目标位置","feedback":"对。Spring 适合直接操作后的回位，但回弹要服务于位置变化，并提供稳定的减弱方案。","correct":true},{"id":"permanent-bounce","label":"让卡片持续来回弹动，直到用户再次点击，强化它具有弹性的感觉","feedback":"持续回弹会让状态无法稳定，也会分散用户对后续任务的注意。","correct":false},{"id":"same-spring-everywhere","label":"把同一组强回弹参数应用到页面所有按钮、弹窗和列表项，保持完全一致","feedback":"不同对象的距离、语义和风险不同；强迫所有元素回弹会削弱层级并干扰严肃操作。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A dragged card should return to its target after release without continuing to wobble. What is the better approach?","options":[{"id":"settling-spring","label":"Use the existing animation system for one small overshoot that settles quickly, and move directly to the target under reduced motion","feedback":"Correct. A spring fits settling after direct manipulation, but the bounce must serve the position change and have a stable reduced alternative.","correct":true},{"id":"permanent-bounce","label":"Keep the card bouncing until the user clicks again so its elasticity remains obvious","feedback":"Continuous bouncing prevents the state from settling and distracts from the next task.","correct":false},{"id":"same-spring-everywhere","label":"Apply the same strong spring to every button, dialog, and list item for complete consistency","feedback":"Objects differ in distance, meaning, and risk; forcing all of them to bounce weakens hierarchy and disrupts serious actions.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"使用项目现有的动画方案，为可拖拽卡片松手回到目标位置加入轻微 Spring 动效。只调整位移，不改卡片内容和拖拽规则；让它最多出现一次轻微过冲并尽快停稳。用户开启“减少动态效果”时直接回到目标位置。改完后分别测试短距离拖拽、长距离拖拽、连续拖拽和减少动态效果状态，确认卡片不会持续晃动或挡住其他内容。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Use the animation approach already present in the project to add a subtle spring when a draggable card returns to its target after release. Animate only its position; do not change the card content or drag rules. Allow at most one small overshoot and make it settle quickly. When reduced motion is enabled, return directly to the target. Test short drags, long drags, repeated drags, and reduced-motion mode, and confirm the card neither keeps wobbling nor covers nearby content."}},"scenes":["拖拽松手回弹","弹窗活泼入场","开关拨动手感","下拉菜单展开"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Drag-and-drop settling","m":"spring-drag"},{"t":"Interactive sheet or drawer","m":"spring-enter"},{"t":"Reordering items","m":"spring-params"},{"t":"A playful control with direct manipulation","m":"spring-fm"}],"dont":[{"t":"Add bounce to every button","m":"spring-bouncy","bad":true},{"t":"Let overshoot cover nearby content","m":"spring-serious","bad":true},{"t":"Use a spring where precise timing must match another event","m":"spring-wobble","bad":true},{"t":"Ignore reduced-motion preferences","m":"spring-everything","bad":true}],"scenes":["Draggable card","Bottom sheet","Reordered list","Playful toggle"],"sceneUI":["<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;padding:6px 0\">\n        <div style=\"width:130px\">\n          <div style=\"height:58px;border:1.5px dashed var(--brand);border-radius:8px;background:var(--brand-light);opacity:.55\"></div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:5px\">Original position</div>\n        </div>\n        <span style=\"font-size:15px;color:var(--text-3)\">↩</span>\n        <div style=\"width:140px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 10px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float);transform:rotate(3deg)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;font-weight:600\">Home page revision review</div>\n          <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Draging...rebound when you let go</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:6px\">spring: Let go and rush back to the original position, overshoot lightly and then stop, as if there is physical quality</div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;height:118px;border-radius:8px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--bg-soft)\">\n        <div style=\"padding:12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:7px\"><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:58%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:78%\"></i><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:42%\"></i></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(29,33,41,.32)\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%) scale(.88);width:224px;height:74px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;opacity:.3\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;left:50%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:224px;background:var(--bg);border-radius:10px;padding:12px 14px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float)\">\n          <div style=\"font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px\">Invite members</div>\n          <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\">\n            <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"flex:1\" value=\"fox@example.com\">\n            <button class=\"btn btn-primary\">Invite</button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:8px\">scale briefly crosses 1 and then returns to a stable value; the afterimage indicates the position of the previous frame</div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:14px 18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:13px;color:var(--text)\">Notification reminder</span>\n          <span style=\"position:relative;display:inline-block;width:56px;height:32px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--brand)\">\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;left:9px;top:13px;width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.35)\"></span>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;left:17px;top:12px;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.5)\"></span>\n            <span style=\"position:absolute;right:1px;top:3px;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.22)\"></span>\n          </span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:12px\">The slider briefly crosses the target position and then rebounds; the residual image on the left indicates the movement trajectory</div>\n    </div>","<div>\n      <div style=\"position:relative;max-width:280px;margin:0 auto;height:138px\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:8px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px;box-shadow:0 0 0 2px var(--brand-light)\">\n          In progress\n          <span style=\"color:var(--text-3);font-size:12px\">▾</span>\n        </div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;top:40px;left:8px;right:8px;height:90px;border:1.5px dashed var(--brand);border-radius:8px;opacity:.35;transform:scale(.96);transform-origin:top\"></div>\n        <div style=\"position:absolute;top:40px;left:0;right:0;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:8px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-float);padding:4px;transform-origin:top\">\n          <div style=\"padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;border-radius:5px;color:var(--text-2)\">All status</div>\n          <div style=\"padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--brand-light);color:var(--brand);font-weight:500\">In progress</div>\n          <div style=\"padding:7px 10px;font-size:12px;border-radius:5px;color:var(--text-2)\">Completed</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);text-align:center;margin-top:8px\">Elastic expansion from the trigger point: scale 0.96 → 1, the dotted line is the previous frame</div>\n    </div>"],"variants":[{"demo":"<svg class=\"spring-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 44\"><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"16\" class=\"spring-v-target\"/><path d=\"M4,38 C50,38 58,10 76,15 C88,19 96,16 116,16\" class=\"spring-v-path\"/></svg>","when":"For a crisp, restrained feel in a productivity tool"},{"demo":"<svg class=\"spring-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 44\"><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"20\" class=\"spring-v-target\"/><path d=\"M4,40 C40,40 44,2 62,14 C76,25 82,13 94,19 C102,23 108,20 116,20\" class=\"spring-v-path\"/></svg>","when":"For a gentle, lively feel in a content or social product"},{"demo":"<svg class=\"spring-v-svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 44\"><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"14\" class=\"spring-v-target\"/><path d=\"M4,38 C54,38 66,14 116,14\" class=\"spring-v-path\"/></svg>","when":"When you want the motion to feel alive without overshooting"}]},"usageMocks":{"spring-drag":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">👆</span><span style=\"width:34px;height:22px;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:4px;box-shadow:0 3px 8px rgba(29,33,41,.14)\"></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">松手 ↩</span></div><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">拖拽松手，弹性回原位</span></div>","spring-enter":"<div class=\"mk-row\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 90 50\" style=\"width:90px;height:50px;flex:none\"><line x1=\"4\" y1=\"14\" x2=\"86\" y2=\"14\" stroke=\"var(--text-3)\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"3 3\"/><path d=\"M4,46 C40,46 46,2 62,12 C74,20 78,14 86,14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--brand)\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></svg><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);max-width:100px\">轻微过冲可用于需要活力的低风险入场</span></div>","spring-params":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\" style=\"width:100%\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3);width:26px\">刚度</span><span cl