</svg><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red);max-width:100px\">阻尼过小会让振荡持续过久</span></div>","spring-everything":"<div class=\"mk-win\"><div class=\"mk-row\"><span style=\"width:18px;height:12px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:2px;transform:rotate(-6deg)\"></span><span style=\"width:18px;height:12px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:2px;transform:rotate(5deg)\"></span><span style=\"width:18px;height:12px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:2px;transform:rotate(-4deg)\"></span><span style=\"width:18px;height:12px;background:var(--brand-light);border:1px solid var(--brand);border-radius:2px;transform:rotate(7deg)\"></span></div><i class=\"mk-line\" style=\"width:70%\"></i><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--red)\">所有元素同时回弹，会削弱层级与重点</span></div>"}}}